# Humility ("All creatures lose all abilities and have base power and toughness 1/1") reaches only creatures. Lord of
# Atlantis is one: its "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk" is gone (CR 613.1f), and since that ability's very
# existence depends on Humility's effect, Humility applies first in layer 6 and the Lord's ability never applies at all
# (CR 613.8a) - though the Lord came first. Glorious Anthem is an enchantment, not a creature, so it keeps "Creatures you
# control get +1/+1", which applies in layer 7c over Humility's base 1/1 (CR 613.4b-c). So on turn 5: the Lord is 1/1 +1
# = 2/2, Cenote Scout 1/1 +1 (the Anthem, no longer the Lord) = 2/2 with no islandwalk, and Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which
# the Anthem does not reach, 1/1. Before Humility (turn 3) the Scout was 3/3 with islandwalk and the Lord 3/3.

